      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's okay but it feels a bit short? i'm worried the ATS might not give me a high enough score if it only sees the keywords a few times. \n\ncould you try doing another version? i really need to maximize that score to get past the first round. try to include those values—Integrity, Innovation, Reliability, Agility, and Sustainability—much more frequently throughout the letter. just make sure they are well-represented so the score is as high as it can possibly be.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
